    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d490">

                <pb facs="0585" n="497" xml:id="pg497"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Loomis to Mr.
                            Glimmeré.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-05-20"><hi rendition="#italic">May 20,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Loomis instructs Mr. Gummeré to urge the authorities of Morocco to make
                    energetic efforts to secure the release of Mr. Perdicaris, and also to punish
                    his abductors, if practicable.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
